agents/counselors/1788305713-review-request-question-review-build-st/prompt.md:28:- Check idempotency and crash safety: the per-activity transaction, journaled_at last, unjournal! on changed activities, the retry on RecordNotUnique in BootstrapJob, two jobs sharing the journal concurrency key
